        <body>
            <trans-unit id="tagline" resname="tagline">
                <source>tagline</source>
                <target>Zeichne für die KI oder errate ihre Zeichnungen.</target>
                <note>Under the title of the home page</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="label.dealt" resname="label.dealt">
                <source>label.dealt</source>
                <target>Wer zuerst zeichnet und das Thema jeder Runde werden zufällig bestimmt.</target>
                <note>Above the button that starts a game</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="label.language" resname="label.language">
                <source>label.language</source>
                <target>Sprache</target>
                <note>Name of the language switcher, for screen readers</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="label.theme" resname="label.theme">
                <source>label.theme</source>
                <target>Thema</target>
                <note>Column of the final score: the theme of each round</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="action.new_game" resname="action.new_game">
                <source>action.new_game</source>
                <target>Neues Spiel</target>
                <note>Button and link that start a new game</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="action.leave_game" resname="action.leave_game">
                <source>action.leave_game</source>
                <target>Spiel verlassen</target>
                <note>In the bar of a round and in the lobby: leaves the game for the home page</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="action.undo" resname="action.undo">
                <source>action.undo</source>
                <target>↶ Letzten Strich löschen</target>
                <note>Removes the last stroke</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="instruction.draw" resname="instruction.draw">
                <source>instruction.draw</source>
                <target>Zeichne:</target>
                <note>Before the word the player must draw</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="heading.ai_guesses" resname="heading.ai_guesses">
                <source>heading.ai_guesses</source>
                <target>Die KI sagt…</target>
                <note>Above the words the AI calls out</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="result.found_in" resname="result.found_in">
                <source>result.found_in</source>
                <target>Gefunden in %seconds% s</target>
                <note>When the AI found the word; %seconds% is a number in an HTML element</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="error.no_word" resname="error.no_word">
                <source>error.no_word</source>
                <target>Die KI konnte kein Wort auswählen. Läuft das Modell? „make check“ zeigt, was nicht stimmt.</target>
                <note>The model gave no word to draw</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="theme.animals" resname="theme.animals">
                <source>theme.animals</source>
                <target>Tiere</target>
                <note>Name of a theme</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="theme.everyday-objects" resname="theme.everyday-objects">
                <source>theme.everyday-objects</source>
                <target>Alltagsgegenstände</target>
                <note>Name of a theme</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="theme.developer" resname="theme.developer">
                <source>theme.developer</source>
                <target>Entwickleralltag</target>
                <note>Name of a theme</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="theme.places" resname="theme.places">
                <source>theme.places</source>
                <target>Orte</target>
                <note>Name of a theme</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="theme.characters" resname="theme.characters">
                <source>theme.characters</source>
                <target>Figuren</target>
                <note>Name of a theme</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="theme.nature" resname="theme.nature">
                <source>theme.nature</source>
                <target>Natur</target>
                <note>Name of a theme</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="theme.transport" resname="theme.transport">
                <source>theme.transport</source>
                <target>Verkehr</target>
                <note>Name of a theme</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="instruction.guess" resname="instruction.guess">
                <source>instruction.guess</source>
                <target>Was zeichnet die KI?</target>
                <note>Above the drawing of the AI</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="label.answer" resname="label.answer">
                <source>label.answer</source>
                <target>Dein Tipp</target>
                <note>Field where the player types a guess</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="action.answer" resname="action.answer">
                <source>action.answer</source>
                <target>Raten</target>
                <note>Sends the guess of the player</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="heading.player_guesses" resname="heading.player_guesses">
                <source>heading.player_guesses</source>
                <target>Deine Tipps</target>
                <note>Above the words the player tried</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="action.give_up" resname="action.give_up">
                <source>action.give_up</source>
                <target>Ich gebe auf</target>
                <note>The player gives up and sees the word</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="result.word_was" resname="result.word_was">
                <source>result.word_was</source>
                <target>Das Wort war %word%</target>
                <note>After giving up; %word% is the word in an HTML element</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="status.ai_thinking" resname="status.ai_thinking">
                <source>status.ai_thinking</source>
                <target>Hmm… mal überlegen</target>
                <note>On the sheet, before the first stroke of the AI</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="status.ai_drawing" resname="status.ai_drawing">
                <source>status.ai_drawing</source>
                <target>Die KI zeichnet…</target>
                <note>While the AI draws</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="status.ai_finished" resname="status.ai_finished">
                <source>status.ai_finished</source>
                <target>Die KI ist mit ihrer Zeichnung fertig.</target>
                <note>When the AI has drawn its last stroke</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="error.ai_drawing" resname="error.ai_drawing">
                <source>error.ai_drawing</source>
                <target>Die KI konnte nicht zeichnen. „make check“ zeigt, was nicht stimmt.</target>
                <note>The model could not draw</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="label.round" resname="label.round">
                <source>label.round</source>
                <target>Runde %number% von %count%</target>
                <note>Number of the round being played</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="label.team_score" resname="label.team_score">
                <source>label.team_score</source>
                <target>Punkte</target>
                <note>Points of the player and the AI together</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="label.time_left" resname="label.time_left">
                <source>label.time_left</source>
                <target>Verbleibende Zeit</target>
                <note>Before the seconds left in the round</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="label.points_at_stake" resname="label.points_at_stake">
                <source>label.points_at_stake</source>
                <target>Dieses Wort bringt</target>
                <note>Before the points the word is worth now, above the gauge</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="heading.round_found" resname="heading.round_found">
                <source>heading.round_found</source>
                <target>Gefunden!</target>
                <note>End of a round: the word was found</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="heading.round_time_up" resname="heading.round_time_up">
                <source>heading.round_time_up</source>
                <target>Die Zeit ist um!</target>
                <note>End of a round: nobody found the word in time</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="heading.round_given_up" resname="heading.round_given_up">
                <source>heading.round_given_up</source>
                <target>Diesmal nicht</target>
                <note>End of a round: the player gave up</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="result.points_won" resname="result.points_won">
                <source>result.points_won</source>
                <target>+%points% Punkte</target>
                <note>Points won in the round</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="action.next_round_player" resname="action.next_round_player">
                <source>action.next_round_player</source>
                <target>Nächste Runde: Du zeichnest</target>
                <note>Starts the next round, drawn by the player</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="action.next_round_ai" resname="action.next_round_ai">
                <source>action.next_round_ai</source>
                <target>Nächste Runde: Die KI zeichnet</target>
                <note>Starts the next round, drawn by the AI</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="action.final_score" resname="action.final_score">
                <source>action.final_score</source>
                <target>Endstand ansehen</target>
                <note>After the last round</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="action.retry" resname="action.retry">
                <source>action.retry</source>
                <target>Nochmal versuchen</target>
                <note>Asks again for a word to draw</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="heading.game_over" resname="heading.game_over">
                <source>heading.game_over</source>
                <target>Spiel vorbei</target>
                <note>Title of the final score page</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="result.final_score" resname="result.final_score">
                <source>result.final_score</source>
                <target>Teampunkte: %points% Punkte</target>
                <note>Final score; %points% is a number in an HTML element</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="result.not_found" resname="result.not_found">
                <source>result.not_found</source>
                <target>nicht gefunden</target>
                <note>In the table of the final score, for a word nobody found</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="column.round" resname="column.round">
                <source>column.round</source>
                <target>Runde</target>
                <note>Column of the final score table</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="column.drawer" resname="column.drawer">
                <source>column.drawer</source>
                <target>Gezeichnet von</target>
                <note>Column of the final score table</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="column.word" resname="column.word">
                <source>column.word</source>
                <target>Wort</target>
                <note>Column of the final score table</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="column.found_in" resname="column.found_in">
                <source>column.found_in</source>
                <target>Gefunden in</target>
                <note>Column of the final score table</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="column.points" resname="column.points">
                <source>column.points</source>
                <target>Punkte</target>
                <note>Column of the final score table</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="drawer.player" resname="drawer.player">
                <source>drawer.player</source>
                <target>du</target>
                <note>Who drew a round: the player</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="drawer.ai" resname="drawer.ai">
                <source>drawer.ai</source>
                <target>die KI</target>
                <note>Who drew a round: the AI</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="label.decimal_separator" resname="label.decimal_separator">
                <source>label.decimal_separator</source>
                <target>,</target>
                <note>Between the units and the tenths of a number of seconds</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="heading.copilot_hints" resname="heading.copilot_hints">
                <source>heading.copilot_hints</source>
                <target>%name% flüstert dir zu…</target>
                <note>Above the words an agent connected over MCP suggests to the player</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="heading.copilot_tips" resname="heading.copilot_tips">
                <source>heading.copilot_tips</source>
                <target>Tipps von %name%</target>
                <note>Above the tips an agent connected over MCP gives to the player who draws</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="heading.lobby" resname="heading.lobby">
                <source>heading.lobby</source>
                <target>Verbinde deinen Copiloten</target>
                <note>Title of the lobby of a game with a copilot</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="action.copy" resname="action.copy">
                <source>action.copy</source>
                <target>Kopieren</target>
                <note>Button next to a command of the lobby</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="status.copied" resname="status.copied">
                <source>status.copied</source>
                <target>Kopiert!</target>
                <note>The command was copied to the clipboard</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="lobby.step_add" resname="lobby.step_add">
                <source>lobby.step_add</source>
                <target>Mit Claude Code, einmalig:</target>
                <note>First step of the lobby, before a command</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="lobby.step_prompt" resname="lobby.step_prompt">
                <source>lobby.step_prompt</source>
                <target>Öffne Claude Code und starte diesen Prompt:</target>
                <note>Second step of the lobby, before a command</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="lobby.other_clients" resname="lobby.other_clients">
                <source>lobby.other_clients</source>
                <target>Ein anderer MCP-Client: Verbinde ihn mit %url% und bitte ihn dann, den Prompt %prompt% auszuführen. Wenn er keine Prompts kennt, sag ihm, er soll das Tool round_status aufrufen, das die Regeln erklärt.</target>
                <note>Under the steps of the lobby</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="status.copilot_waiting" resname="status.copilot_waiting">
                <source>status.copilot_waiting</source>
                <target>Warte auf deinen Copiloten…</target>
                <note>In the lobby, until the agent calls the game</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="status.copilot_connected" resname="status.copilot_connected">
                <source>status.copilot_connected</source>
                <target>Copilot verbunden: %name%</target>
                <note>In the lobby, once the agent called the game; %name% is the name of its MCP client</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="status.copilot_absent" resname="status.copilot_absent">
                <source>status.copilot_absent</source>
                <target>Dein Copilot ist nicht verbunden</target>
                <note>In the bar of a round, when the copilot never called the game</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="action.start_game" resname="action.start_game">
                <source>action.start_game</source>
                <target>Spiel starten</target>
                <note>Leaves the lobby: the first round starts</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="role.drawer" resname="role.drawer">
                <source>role.drawer</source>
                <target>Die Zeichen-KI</target>
                <note>Name of the role of the model that draws, on the home page</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="role.guesser" resname="role.guesser">
                <source>role.guesser</source>
                <target>Die Rate-KI</target>
                <note>Name of the role of the model that picks the word and guesses, on the home page</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="status.checking_models" resname="status.checking_models">
                <source>status.checking_models</source>
                <target>Die Modelle werden geprüft…</target>
                <note>Home page, while the models are tried</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="status.models_slow" resname="status.models_slow">
                <source>status.models_slow</source>
                <target>Der Server des Modells antwortet langsam. Ein lokales Modell wird beim ersten Aufruf in den Speicher geladen, das kann eine Minute dauern.</target>
                <note>Home page, when checking the models takes more than 5 s</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="help.models" resname="help.models">
                <source>help.models</source>
                <target>Ein Modell antwortet nicht wie erwartet. Stelle AI_DRAWER_* und AI_GUESSER_* in .env.local ein (siehe README) und versuche es dann noch einmal. „make check“ sagt dir im Terminal dasselbe.</target>
                <note>Home page, when a model fails its check</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="action.check_again" resname="action.check_again">
                <source>action.check_again</source>
                <target>Noch einmal prüfen</target>
                <note>Home page: tries the models again</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="status.picking_word" resname="status.picking_word">
                <source>status.picking_word</source>
                <target>Die KI wählt ein Wort…</target>
                <note>Loading screen, while the model picks the word of a round</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="status.picking_word_note" resname="status.picking_word_note">
                <source>status.picking_word_note</source>
                <target>Das kann ein paar Sekunden dauern.</target>
                <note>Loading screen, under the title</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="label.mode" resname="label.mode">
                <source>label.mode</source>
                <target>So spiele ich</target>
                <note>Home page, above the choice of the mode</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="mode.solo" resname="mode.solo">
                <source>mode.solo</source>
                <target>Im Team mit der KI</target>
                <note>Home page, a mode of the game</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="mode.copilot" resname="mode.copilot">
                <source>mode.copilot</source>
                <target>Mit einem Copiloten</target>
                <note>Home page, a mode of the game</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="mode.duel" resname="mode.duel">
                <source>mode.duel</source>
                <target>Im Duell</target>
                <note>Home page, a mode of the game</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="heading.lobby_duel" resname="heading.lobby_duel">
                <source>heading.lobby_duel</source>
                <target>Verbinde deinen Gegner</target>
                <note>Title of the lobby of a duel</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="status.rival_waiting" resname="status.rival_waiting">
                <source>status.rival_waiting</source>
                <target>Warte auf deinen Gegner…</target>
                <note>In the lobby of a duel, until the agent calls the game</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="status.rival_connected" resname="status.rival_connected">
                <source>status.rival_connected</source>
                <target>Gegner verbunden: %name%</target>
                <note>In the lobby of a duel, once the agent called the game; %name% is the name of its MCP client</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="label.you" resname="label.you">
                <source>label.you</source>
                <target>Du und deine KI</target>
                <note>In the bar of a duel, before the score of the player</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="label.rival_unknown" resname="label.rival_unknown">
                <source>label.rival_unknown</source>
                <target>Gegner</target>
                <note>Name of the rival of a duel before it called the game</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="heading.rival_answers" resname="heading.rival_answers">
                <source>heading.rival_answers</source>
                <target>%name% rät gegen dich…</target>
                <note>Above the answers of the rival in a duel; %name% is the name of its MCP client</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="heading.round_found_by_rival" resname="heading.round_found_by_rival">
                <source>heading.round_found_by_rival</source>
                <target>%name% hat es gefunden!</target>
                <note>End of a round of a duel, when the rival found the word</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="result.points_won_by_rival" resname="result.points_won_by_rival">
                <source>result.points_won_by_rival</source>
                <target>+%points% Punkte für %name%</target>
                <note>End of a round of a duel, when the rival found the word</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="result.duel_score" resname="result.duel_score">
                <source>result.duel_score</source>
                <target>Du und deine KI %you% Punkte, %name% %rival% Punkte</target>
                <note>Final screen of a duel</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="result.duel_won" resname="result.duel_won">
                <source>result.duel_won</source>
                <target>Du und deine KI gewinnt das Duell!</target>
                <note>Final screen of a duel</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="result.duel_lost" resname="result.duel_lost">
                <source>result.duel_lost</source>
                <target>%name% gewinnt das Duell.</target>
                <note>Final screen of a duel</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="result.duel_tie" resname="result.duel_tie">
                <source>result.duel_tie</source>
                <target>Unentschieden!</target>
                <note>Final screen of a duel</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="column.found_by" resname="column.found_by">
                <source>column.found_by</source>
                <target>Gefunden von</target>
                <note>Final screen of a duel, a column</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="found_by.player" resname="found_by.player">
                <source>found_by.player</source>
                <target>du</target>
                <note>Who found the word of a round: the player</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="found_by.ai" resname="found_by.ai">
                <source>found_by.ai</source>
                <target>deine KI</target>
                <note>Who found the word of a round: the AI of the player</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="label.copilot_unknown" resname="label.copilot_unknown">
                <source>label.copilot_unknown</source>
                <target>Dein Copilot</target>
                <note>Name of the copilot when its MCP client gives none</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="heading.round_found_by_you" resname="heading.round_found_by_you">
                <source>heading.round_found_by_you</source>
                <target>Du hast es gefunden!</target>
                <note>End of a round of a duel, when the player found the word</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="heading.round_found_by_your_ai" resname="heading.round_found_by_your_ai">
                <source>heading.round_found_by_your_ai</source>
                <target>Deine KI hat es gefunden!</target>
                <note>End of a round of a duel, when the AI of the player found the word</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="result.points_won_by_you" resname="result.points_won_by_you">
                <source>result.points_won_by_you</source>
                <target>+%points% Punkte für dich und deine KI</target>
                <note>End of a round of a duel, when the side of the player found the word</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="heading.your_ai_guesses" resname="heading.your_ai_guesses">
                <source>heading.your_ai_guesses</source>
                <target>Deine KI sagt…</target>
                <note>In a duel, above the words of the AI of the player while the player draws</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="mode.solo_hint" resname="mode.solo_hint">
                <source>mode.solo_hint</source>
                <target>Du zeichnest für sie, du errätst ihre Zeichnungen, ihr punktet zusammen.</target>
                <note>Home page, under a mode of the game</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="mode.copilot_hint" resname="mode.copilot_hint">
                <source>mode.copilot_hint</source>
                <target>Ein Agent wie Claude Code oder Vibe hilft dir beim Raten und Zeichnen.</target>
                <note>Home page, under a mode of the game</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="mode.duel_hint" resname="mode.duel_hint">
                <source>mode.duel_hint</source>
                <target>Ein Agent wie Claude Code oder Vibe spielt gegen dich und deine KI.</target>
                <note>Home page, under a mode of the game</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="mode.via_mcp" resname="mode.via_mcp">
                <source>mode.via_mcp</source>
                <target>über MCP</target>
                <note>Home page, on the cards of the modes with an agent</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="lobby.copilot_does" resname="lobby.copilot_does">
                <source>lobby.copilot_does</source>
                <target>Was dein Copilot macht</target>
                <note>Lobby of a game with a copilot, above the list of what the agent does</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="lobby.copilot_does_1" resname="lobby.copilot_does_1">
                <source>lobby.copilot_does_1</source>
                <target>Wenn die KI zeichnet, sieht er sich die Zeichnung an, genau wie du.</target>
                <note>Lobby, what the copilot does</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="lobby.copilot_does_2" resname="lobby.copilot_does_2">
                <source>lobby.copilot_does_2</source>
                <target>Er flüstert dir Wörter am Rand zu, höchstens 5 pro Runde.</target>
                <note>Lobby, what the copilot does</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="lobby.copilot_does_3" resname="lobby.copilot_does_3">
                <source>lobby.copilot_does_3</source>
                <target>Du klickst auf ein Wort, um es als Antwort zu geben: Du entscheidest immer.</target>
                <note>Lobby, what the copilot does</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="lobby.copilot_does_4" resname="lobby.copilot_does_4">
                <source>lobby.copilot_does_4</source>
                <target>Wenn du zeichnest, gibt er dir Tipps, damit die KI das Wort findet.</target>
                <note>Lobby, what the copilot does</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="lobby.duel_does" resname="lobby.duel_does">
                <source>lobby.duel_does</source>
                <target>Was dein Gegner macht</target>
                <note>Lobby of a duel, above the list of what the agent does</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="lobby.duel_does_1" resname="lobby.duel_does_1">
                <source>lobby.duel_does_1</source>
                <target>Er rät dieselben Zeichnungen wie du, die der KI und deine.</target>
                <note>Lobby, what the rival does</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="lobby.duel_does_2" resname="lobby.duel_does_2">
                <source>lobby.duel_does_2</source>
                <target>Wenn du zeichnest, rät deine KI für dich.</target>
                <note>Lobby, what the rival does</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="lobby.duel_does_3" resname="lobby.duel_does_3">
                <source>lobby.duel_does_3</source>
                <target>Wer das Wort zuerst findet, bekommt die Punkte.</target>
                <note>Lobby, what the rival does</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="lobby.duel_does_4" resname="lobby.duel_does_4">
                <source>lobby.duel_does_4</source>
                <target>Er antwortet höchstens alle 3 Sekunden, und für ihn zählt nur das genaue Wort.</target>
                <note>Lobby, what the rival does</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="lobby.connect" resname="lobby.connect">
                <source>lobby.connect</source>
                <target>Verbinden</target>
                <note>Lobby, above the steps to connect the agent</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="lobby.vision" resname="lobby.vision">
                <source>lobby.vision</source>
                <target>Sein Modell muss Bilder sehen können: Der Agent schaut sich die Zeichnung an. Ein reines Textmodell scheitert gleich beim ersten Blick.</target>
                <note>Lobby, under the heading of the steps to connect the agent</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="status.copilot_connected_unnamed" resname="status.copilot_connected_unnamed">
                <source>status.copilot_connected_unnamed</source>
                <target>Dein Copilot ist verbunden.</target>
                <note>In the lobby, once the agent called the game, when it has no name</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="status.rival_connected_unnamed" resname="status.rival_connected_unnamed">
                <source>status.rival_connected_unnamed</source>
                <target>Dein Gegner ist verbunden.</target>
                <note>In the lobby of a duel, once the agent called the game, when it has no name</note>
            </trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="label.copilot_named" resname="label.copilot_named">
                <source>label.copilot_named</source>
                <target>%name%, dein Copilot</target>
                <note>In the bar of a round with a copilot</note>
            </trans-unit>
